    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"step away from the struggle\"... i dont know. it just feels like no matter what i do, the weight is always gonna be there. like, if the universe is this big and empty, why am i even fighting so hard to stay in it? it feels more like a chore than a gift at this point. it's almost like the only way to actually find peace is to just... stop. does that even make sense?",
